// Ordinary-network Character traversal through the eastern woodland gradient. Each
// destination starts from the exact seed and follows the northern Waterfall A/Frozen
// Hills detour around the canonical hostile; combat is not suppressed. The Sky
// Islands destination is the region's grounded bridge; no flight is faked.
